{"id":312,"gn":"Pokémon Acclameur","ft":["Il encourage ses amis. Son corps produit plus d’étincelles quand il est en mauvaise posture.","L’électricité de Posipi et Négapi favorise la circulation sanguine et guérit les courbatures.","Négapi n’hésite pas à se mettre en danger pour soutenir ses partenaires. Il court-circuite son corps pour faire jaillir des gerbes d’étincelles et donner du cœur à l’ouvrage à ses équipiers.","Négapi adore encourager son partenaire pendant les combats. Des étincelles jaillissent alors de son corps. Lorsque son partenaire est en difficulté, le corps de ce Pokémon libère encore plus d’étincelles."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":1,"24":0,"25":2,"26":3},"gr":4,"cr":200,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Féerique"],"gw":"medium","gm":{"svdisk":[0,120],"sv":[2,120],"oras":[0,83],"xy":[0,97],"e":[0,81],"rs":[0,81]},"f":{"312":{"n":"Négapi","t":["electric"],"s":[60,40,50,75,85,95],"h":0.4,"w":4.2,"a":[[58,0],[10,1]],"pa":[[5,[[58,0]]]],"av":["svdisk","sv","oras","xy","e","rs"],"hi":[[589,5,[25,26,27,28,29,30]]],"ls":[{"l":[[98,1],[589,1],[45,1],[86,1],[270,4],[209,7],[227,10],[415,13],[129,16],[486,19],[383,22],[268,26],[435,31],[226,34],[97,37],[387,40],[87,43],[417,46],[494,49]],"m":[9,85,86,87,97,113,129,156,162,164,182,189,203,204,214,226,227,240,253,263,268,270,283,313,374,417,447,451,486,521,527,528,583,604,851,885,914],"e":[47,186,204,273,313,609]},{"l":[[609,1],[589,1],[45,1],[86,1],[98,1],[270,4],[209,7],[227,10],[415,13],[129,16],[486,19],[383,22],[313,25],[268,28],[435,31],[226,34],[97,37],[376,40],[87,43],[417,46],[494,49]],"m":[85,86,87,92,104,113,148,156,164,182,207,213,214,216,218,237,240,263,290,374,447,451,496,497,521,528,590],"e":[47,186,204,273,313,381,435],"t":[9,173,231,253,270,324,351,387,393,527]},{"l":[[417,1],[609,1],[494,1],[589,1],[45,1],[86,3],[98,7],[270,10],[209,15],[227,17],[204,21],[383,24],[486,29],[129,31],[313,35],[268,38],[87,42],[226,44],[97,48],[376,51],[417,56],[494,63]],"m":[85,86,87,92,104,113,148,156,164,182,207,213,214,